## [v1.4.1] - 2026-04-27

Speed optimizations for the Analysis UI.

Warning: No backwards compatibility for old databases.

### Added
 - Analysis: per-snapshot view tables for nameservers, endpoints, and ASNs, populated at capture time
 - Analysis: consolidated `overview_v2` aggregate so the overview tab loads with one `/overview` call
 - API: `Cache-Control: immutable` + ETag on captured-snapshot responses; `no-cache` on auto-latest
 - Config: `public_api.analysis_request_timeout` (default 10s) and tunable DB pool (`max_open_conns`, `max_idle_conns`, `conn_max_lifetime_seconds`)
 - public-ui: detect initial locale from localStorage or navigator.languages and persist manual changes
 - public-ui: persist theme choice to localStorage and restore it on load

### Changed
 - Analysis: Nameservers / Endpoints / ASNs / Overview tabs serve from view tables instead of scanning fact rows
 - Analysis: per-snapshot `singleflight` replaces the global cache mutex so different snapshots compute in parallel
 - Analysis: `DeleteBatch` cascades through the new view tables
 - Public UI: Fixed locale chunk emission so non-en translations actually load
 - Analysis UI: Replace raw 404 page-not-found with a clear no-content-yet message when a public cohort has no captured snapshot

## [v1.4.0] - 2026-04-24

New **Analysis UI** with cohorts from tags in the Admin UI! Also test case explanations in the Public UI. 

### Added
 - Analysis: immutable cohort snapshots, one per snapshot-intent batch
 - Analysis: new per-cohort snapshots list / detail / trends / diff endpoints on the public API; every existing endpoint accepts `?snapshot=<slug>`
 - Admin UI: snapshot-intent checkbox, per-cohort "Run new snapshot", snapshots sub-panel with set-default / retire / restore / purge
 - Admin UI: manual batch deletion with impact preview and typed confirmation from the Batch inspector, the tag detail "Earlier batches" panel, and the cohort snapshot row
 - API: `GET /api/v1/tags/{name}/batches`, `GET /api/v1/batches/{id}/delete-preview`, `DELETE /api/v1/batches/{id}` cascades the batch row, runs, entries, fact tables and snapshots in one transaction
 - Analysis UI: snapshot selector, overview pill, Trends and Diff tabs
 - Docs: [docs/cohort-snapshots.md](docs/cohort-snapshots.md), [docs/batch-deletion.md](docs/batch-deletion.md)
 - Public UI: Explanations for WARNINGS, ERRORS, and CRITICAL
 - Analysis UI: A link to the test case specification from the test module pill

### Changed
 - Analysis: public read path now pins to a resolved snapshot; latest-per-domain collapsing is gone, old bookmarks auto-resolve to the newest captured snapshot
 - Analysis: first-boot backfill creates one snapshot per historical (cohort, batch) pair
 - Docs: Reorganized the documentation structure
 - Public UI: Show unresolvable and unreachable nameservers in nameserver response times
  - Admin: deleting the batch behind a cohort's pinned default snapshot reverts the cohort to auto_latest instead of leaving a dangling default pointer that hid every remaining snapshot from the analysis UI

