## [v1.3.0] - 2026-04-12

Major performance increase, and new admin and public UI layout, and new scoring engine!

### Added
 - Engine: Cross-job nameserver hot-cache, consecutive-timeout fast-fail, and per-nameserver concurrency cap are now on by default, raising batch throughput by ~2.8× on 8-core hosts compared to the previous defaults
 - New scoring engine, implemented for public and admin UI, CLI, and Nagios command

### Changed
 - UI: Web UI layouts are improved
 - UI: Migrated all components to Svelte 5 runes, modern events, callback props
 - Engine: Finnish language update, updates for all languages

